		// haze reads as part of the menu rather than a colour bolted onto it.
		// Colour iteration so far, do not re-propose the rejects:
		//   1 0.78 0.55    warm amber  -- too pale
		//   1 0.42 0.1     brand orange (GF_LINK_COLOR) -- too much full-screen
		//   0.8 0.12 0.12  the HUD's enemy red -- rejected
		// If gold is also off, suspect SATURATION not hue: stock's teal works
		// partly because it is muted (0.384 0.725 0.725). Levers are desaturating
		// toward the same hue, or dropping the fog's 0.5 alpha below.
		// ⚠ The RGB only lands if the material honours its colour register. Stock
		// tinting menu_mp_background_glow teal is the proof it does for the glow;
		// if the fog ever looks stubbornly grey, that layer ignores RGB and the
		// only fix is a custom .iwi.
